luxafor-ui (0.3.0) unknown; urgency=medium

  * feat: Customizability just landed
    * You can now customize your status messages in Slack using the `settings.json` file in your home config directory
      The file is located at `~/.config/luxafor-ui/settings.json` on Linux and Mac
  * chore(deps): Bump the weekly-cargo group with 4
  * feat(ci): Add CI tests, cargo-check all targets and features
  * feat(ci): Cargo hack everything
  * fix(slack): Fix Slack token refresh after reinstall

